  {
   "id": "teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-shredder-s-revenge-144465@major-2022-12-22",
   "gameId": "teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-shredder-s-revenge-144465",
   "displayName": "NEW UPDATE AVAILABLE: CRT & VCR filters, Custom Arcade mode, and More!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-22T18:00:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cowabunga!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This year, Christmas arrives a bit earlier than usual: we are happy to announce that a free update has just been deployed for Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Shredder’s Revenge, adding its share of new features and quality of life improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Amongst several fixes, you will be able to experience the game from some brand new perspectives:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "CRT & VCR filters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now choose between 3 filters to enjoy TMNT: Shredder’s Revenge like a good ol’ Saturday morning cartoon. So bring your PJs and your cereals, nostalgia is waiting for you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Custom Arcade Mode (Dip Switches)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now customize your TMNT: Shredder’s Revenge experience as you please thanks to the Dip Switches!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don’t want the taunts to refill your Ninja Power gauge? Done. Want your Super Attacks to now cost health instead of Ninja Power? That’s now a thing too. Want you and your friends to play with the same character? Enjoy!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And those are just a few examples of what the dip switches can offer: on top of bringing 11 tweaking possibilities, you can also mix and match them to create your own TMNT: Shredder’s Revenge experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can check out the full changelog at the end of this news to learn more about all the fixes, changes and addition of this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Did we say all this is free? Because it is. Oh and we also added a 20% discount until January 5th on top of that, the cherry on top of pizza!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you will have a lot of fun trying out this update and once again, we thank you for your support and wish you all amazing Holidays.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Tribute Games & Dotemu teams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "@TributeGames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "@Dotemu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "------------- COMPLETE CHANGELOG -------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "NEW FEATURES",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new Arcade mode is here: Custom Game! Just like an actual arcade machine: customize your game experience using DIP switches: free play, old-school Super Attacks, faster enemies, no more taunts, and many more! You can see the customization in the lobbies of Custom Games. Achievements’ progression and unlocking is disabled in Custom Games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Online",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the Character Select menu, the host can now set a maximum number of players for the lobby.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Graphics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added come awesome filters: CRT (normal or curved) and VCR! Check them out in the Options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIXES",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed rare crash in Arcade mode when changing difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cars can no longer deal massive damage when the player is considered Armored (for example: charging a Heavy Swing).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bosses sometimes unable to reach a player positioned at the very top or bottom of the stage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bosses sometimes frozen after being hit by Raphael's Super Flying Attack.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Score not kept for player when switching character after a continue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed April's Super Flying Attack sometimes seemingly reviving KO'ed enemies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed reviving a KO player near the transition point (for example: escalators in the Crystal Palace Mall) that would sometimes prevent progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed updating the timer for special statuses (for example: Infinite Ninja Power) when KO or in a cutscene.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Online",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Guest players can now rejoin the same hosted game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed input not correctly assessed when selecting between Backflip or Roundoff when turning around.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Menus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed rare soft lock occurring in the World Map if the user completed Stage 8 after finishing Stage 10.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENTS",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Taunt now only fills up the first Ninja Power bar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We no longer clear fully accumulated Ninja Power bars when KO on Chill difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Doing a throw now grants the player invulnerability.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added more feedback in the HUD when trying to do a Super Attack without enough Ninja Power.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many small animation tweaks were made to all bosses, often to make attacks easier to read.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Dirtbag’s dig holes collision detection that was too wide and deep.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced the number of enemies spawned in Zorax’s stampede and the frequency of stampedes. Zorax also has a bit less health when facing multiple players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rat King now does Pied Piper less frequently.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the Super Shredder fight in many small ways for a smoother pacing and tweaked some damage values. His grab is now used more frequently and is more efficient, though. Bummer dude!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Statue of Tyranny pacing and tweaked some damage values.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mother Mouser has a new bite animation to differentiate the charge bite from the idle bite, to give players time to react.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mouser Model 3 and Mother Mouser are now acting a bit faster.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Radical Mode damage multiplier is now applied to all throws, Super Dive Attack, and charged Heavy Swing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed players sometimes falling outside of the screen repeatedly when respawning, at specific locations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Online",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a Refresh button to the lobby search list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We improved the way the Arcade score is calculated: we now record each player individually, even if they leave the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Localization",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrected or improved a few strings in Spanish, French and German.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Menus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game will remember if How To Play was seen before, separately in Story and Arcade modes as they differ.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the prompt to reset your story and character progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pause menu in Arcade mode now shows the total play time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Input: improved support for PS5 controllers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "______________________________________",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
